    "title": "Stem Split Vocals",
    "author": "groovy",
    "description": "Demucs separates vocals, drums, bass, and other — preview all four stems; save vocals to exports. Loads OpenSTEM .stem.mp4 mix (stream 0) via ffmpeg. Requires demucs via Model Browser.",
    "tags": ["featured", "ai", "separation", "stems", "vocals"],
    "created_at": "2026-07-06T12:00:00Z",
